  <!-- EN: electricity -->
  <RR_ElectricityBasics.label>电</RR_ElectricityBasics.label>
  <!-- EN: Harness the power of electricity. -->
  <RR_ElectricityBasics.description>驾驭电力。</RR_ElectricityBasics.description>
  <!-- EN: Your colony has harnessed the power which outsiders call "electricity". It has the potential to transform every aspect of your people's way of life.\n\nYou have now unlocked the Power tab in the Architect menu from which you may build electric generators, power conduits, and other mechanisms to control this new force. The Power tab also displays the electric grid which connects electric generators and appliances. -->
  <RR_ElectricityBasics.discoveredLetterText>你的殖民地掌握了外人所谓的“电力”。它有潜力改造人民生活的方方面面。\n\n你现在可以在「建筑规划」菜单中新解锁的「电力」选项卡内建造发电机、电缆，以及其他用于控制这一新力量的装置。该选项卡还会显示连接发电机与用电设备的电网。</RR_ElectricityBasics.discoveredLetterText>
  <!-- EN: About: Electricity -->
  <RR_ElectricityBasics.discoveredLetterTitle>关于：电力</RR_ElectricityBasics.discoveredLetterTitle>
