  <RR_ElectricityBasics.generalRules.rulesStrings.2>subject_story->在中世纪科技世界制作了第一只灯泡</RR_ElectricityBasics.generalRules.rulesStrings.2>
  <RR_ElectricityBasics.generalRules.rulesStrings.3>subject_story->在封建世界因制造光明而被处死</RR_ElectricityBasics.generalRules.rulesStrings.3>
